## Critical Notes
<critical>
- Use `claim()` instead of `get_claim()` for accessing receipt claims
- Use `seal_bytes()` instead of `get_seal()` for accessing receipt seals
- Access `verifier_parameters` instead of `exit_code` in metadata
- Handle both Succinct and Composite receipt variants correctly
- Never use deprecated API methods from pre-1.2.1 versions
- Implement proper error handling for all receipt operations
- Test receipt handling with both Succinct and Composite variants
</critical> 